tachyon-blueprint 1
# Whitechapel in the fog, for Grimoire's Sects & Violets games.
# Made by town/make-whitechapel.mjs; edit that and run it again. `label x y Name` names a place.
name whitechapel
size 104 88 2
key . floor cobble
key # wall brick
key + floor wood
key ~ floor water
key , floor mud
key : floor gravel
key S wall stone block
key s floor stone block
key " floor grass
key < stair-up wood
key > stair-down wood
key ; floor cobble | gas lamp
key _ floor wood | door
key = floor grass | statue
key % floor wood | candle
key & floor wood | table
key * stair-up stone block
key - floor stone block | altar
key ^ floor stone block | candle
key ' floor wood | chest
key ` floor wood | bed
key ! floor stone block | pew
key ? floor gravel | gas lamp
key $ floor stone block | door
key @ floor wood | barrel
key A floor wood | gas lamp
key B floor wood | clock
key C floor wood | chair
key D floor wood | anvil
key E floor cobble | chair
key F floor stone block | clock
key G floor cobble | cart
key H floor stone block | loom
key I floor wood | brazier
key J floor stone block | oven
key K floor stone block | gas lamp
key L floor water | plank bridge
key M stair-down stone block
key N floor stone block | bell
level 0
